# Directory spec for the `common` crate. Coarse boundary only; each domain module
# (jukebox, package model, engines) is specified by its own same-basename spec.

Spec: common

Platform: Rust

Purpose:
  Shared library crate carrying every Vynil-specific type used by the agent, operator, and
  server. It wraps the external `vynil-core` toolbox into the Vynil layer: the four CRD
  models, the package model, the context-aware Handlebars helpers, the Vynil Rhai bindings,
  the order-preserving YAML helpers, and the status-condition macros.

Structure:
  ./src/lib.rs: Crate root — `@Error` (33 variants), `@Result`, `@RhaiRes`, `@rhai_err`,
    shared wire types, re-exports
  ./src/context.rs: `@VynilContext` process context, async client and owner-label helpers
  ./src/jukebox.rs: CRD-backed `@JukeBox` model, source variants, status setters
  ./src/jukebox_file.rs: file-scan JukeBox variant (no cluster connection)
  ./src/vynilpackage.rs: `@VynilPackage` model, requirements, version/cluster checks
  ./src/instanceservice.rs: `@ServiceInstance` model, service-name TTL index, Rhai bridge
  ./src/instancesystem.rs: `@SystemInstance` model and Rhai bridge
  ./src/instancetenant.rs: `@TenantInstance` model, tenant identity helpers, Rhai bridge
  ./src/instance_macros.rs: six `#[macro_export]` status-condition and instance codegen macros
  ./src/handlebarshandler.rs: Vynil Handlebars layer and nine contextual helpers
  ./src/rhaihandler.rs: `@Script` engine constructors (core, real, file-scan, mock)
  ./src/yamlhandler.rs: order-preserving `@YamlDoc` helpers and serde_yaml re-exports
  ./src/tools.rs: base64+gzip text codec for tfstate/rhaistate payloads
  ./src/ttl_cache.rs: `@TtlCache` async single-slot TTL cache
  ./src/k8smock.rs: in-memory Kubernetes/OCI Rhai mocks (product-compiled, ungated)

Owns:
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./Cargo.toml

Must:
  Expose only types and helpers genuinely shared across two or more consuming crates.
  Keep the Rust-level ordered-YAML surface (`@YamlDoc`) confined to `./src/yamlhandler.rs`;
    the `vynil-core` JSON paths (`@yaml_str_to_json` and friends) order their objects by
    document insertion, not alphabetically — `handlebars` unifies the `preserve_order`
    `serde_json` feature across the workspace graph, so no path in this crate sorts keys.
  Re-export the generic `vynil-core` engines behind Vynil newtypes so consumers do not select
    the engine layer themselves.

Must not:
  Depend on `agent`, `operator`, or `server`.
  Duplicate generic engine helpers already provided by `vynil-core`.

Depends on:
  `vynil-core`
  `kube`, `k8s-openapi`, `handlebars`, `rhai`, `serde_yaml`, `rust-yaml`

References:
  ./src/lib.sdd, ./src/context.sdd, ./src/jukebox.sdd, ./src/jukebox_file.sdd
  ./src/vynilpackage.sdd, ./src/instanceservice.sdd, ./src/instancesystem.sdd
  ./src/instancetenant.sdd, ./src/instance_macros.sdd, ./src/handlebarshandler.sdd
  ./src/rhaihandler.sdd, ./src/yamlhandler.sdd, ./src/tools.sdd, ./src/ttl_cache.sdd
  ./src/k8smock.sdd — the file-level contracts; this directory spec stays coarse and defers
    all file behavior to them.

Done when:
  Each domain module above has a reviewed same-basename spec and `cargo test -p common` is green.

Tasks:
  [x] #0 Spec `./src/vynilpackage.rs` (package model, requirements, checks).
  [x] #1 Spec the four instance-model modules and `./src/instance_macros.rs`.
  [x] #2 Spec `./src/jukebox.rs` and `./src/jukebox_file.rs`.
  [x] #3 Spec the Handlebars, Rhai, and YAML handler modules.
  [x] #4 Spec `./src/lib.rs`, `./src/context.rs`, `./src/tools.rs`, `./src/ttl_cache.rs`,
      `./src/k8smock.rs`.
